  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dc61b8a3c634bca48a8da2c364450509, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - I'm not the right person.
  - The air is so heavy.
  - Save me from myself.
  - Begging you.
  - Eyes tell things.
  - How do you feel?
  - It is my last day.
  - I'm okay with one night stands.
  - Just do it.
  - No need for a reason.
  - I don't want to need you.
  - I love you for who you are.
  - Listen to my fav songs.
  - Listen to me.
  - There's no time.
  - I'm freaking out.
  - I love you.
  - Look into my eyes.
  - We're made of star dust.
  - We're alone here.
  - Keep me company.
  - Don't go.
  - I'm scared of the dark.
  - I'm a little child inside.
  - I'm cold.
  - I feel like I know you.
  - I feel like a butterfly.
  - I don't like my voice.
  - This place is too big.
  - This is my planet.
  - I'm the best.
  - I'm pathetic.
  - Don't fall in love.
  - I have shit to do.
  - I wanna die.
  - Rest will flow.
  - Look at the stars.
  - Stars tell things.
  - It's so meaningless.
  - I feel empty.
  - I feel dead.
  - My passion is gone.
  - I'll make my dreams come true.
  - I hate you.
  - Everything is so digital.
  - Where are my parents?
  - I left so many people.
  - I left my parents.
  - Can't commit to anything.
  - Am I fat?
  - Are you okay?
  - You look nice.
  - I'm depressed.
